   SainTek; Univ Potensi Utama; Univ Islam Negeri Syarif Hidayatullah
   Jakarta},
Abstract = {In Medan City is the third largest city in Indonesia after Surabaya, so
   it is not surprising that there are a lot of freight forwarders who
   offer freight services to the public. Where most of the average of the
   goods delivery partner is not only in the field but the national and
   even international. Thus, many people are still confused to choose which
   shipping service partners are best seen from the characteristics of such
   items as fragile, fragile, large dimensions and so on. So it raises the
   risk when the process of delivery of goods. For that, need to build a
   system that can help people in taking a decision. The model used to
   build this Decision Support System uses Smart Method and Profile
   Matching. It is expected that decisions are more objective, so that
   partners are selected according to the needs of the community and can
   minimize errors. Accuracy calculation results from 9 data used as a
   comparison based on respondent data service user transport. Testing
   results from 18 respondents obtained obtained statistical data to find
   the value of weight criteria, from the system and then applied to a web
   to determine the appropriate carrier service partners.},
ISBN = {978-1-5386-5433-0},
ResearcherID-Numbers = {Setiawan, Adil/AEB-3999-2022},
