Abstract = {In this work, we propose a multi-objective optimal scheduling strategy
   for air-conditioning devices to optimize both energy consumption and
   thermal comfort for the users. We propose a graph-based modeling for the
   problem and utilize Johnson's all elementary circuit finding algorithm
   to obtain the desired solutions. The proposed methodology has been
   experimented on test cases that mimic real-world scenario, and further,
   the applicability of Karp's minimum mean cycle algorithm is also studied
   in this problem set-up.},
